{title: Thousand in Shifts}
{subtitle: 1 Kings 5:27–32}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 82}
{time: 3/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | ×10
| [F#] | [C#] | [G#m] | [D#m] |
