{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Solomon conscripted [C#]laborers from all Is[D#m]rael
Thirty thousand men in all [C#]counted the [D#m]roll
Sent [B]to Lebanon [F#]in shifts of [C#]ten thousand
One [B]month away two months at [C#]home in the [D#m]soil
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Adoniram was [F#]in charge of the [C#]forced labor
Super[B]vising the work with a [F#]heavy [C#]hand
Seventy [D#m]thousand carrying [F#]loads on the [C#]mountain
Eighty [B]thousand quarrying [C#]stone in the [D#m]land
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [F#] |
| [C#] | [C#] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D#m]Three thousand three hundred [C#]foremen stood in [D#m]charge
Overseeing the project and the [C#]workers be[D#m]low
At the [B]king's command they [F#]quarried huge [C#]blocks
Costly [B]dressed stone for the foun[C#]dation of God's [D#m]house
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Adoniram was [F#]in charge of the [C#]forced labor
Super[B]vising the work with a [F#]heavy [C#]hand
Seventy [D#m]thousand carrying [F#]loads on the moun[C#]tain
Eighty [B]thousand quarrying [C#]stone in the [D#m]land
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [F#] |
| [C#] | [C#] |

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[D#m]Solomon's builders and [C#]Hiram's men joined to[D#m]gether
With the men of Gebal cutting and [C#]shaping the [D#m]stone
Pre[B]paring the timber for the [F#]temple of the [C#]Lord
[B]Building the house as the [C#]king commanded to [D#m]show
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[B]Cut and [C#]shaped them for the [D#m]temple's [A#m]glory
Prepared the [B]stone for [C#]the Lord's ho[B]ly [C#]ground
{end_of_verse}

